(2. Executive Overview) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(This report assesses an intrusion into the Meridian Grid Services corporate network) Tj
T*
(that occurred in September 2026. Operational technology networks were not affected.) Tj
T*
(The intrusion was contained, and no evidence of data exfiltration has been found to date.) Tj
T*
T*
(The assessment describes the affected systems, the timeline of the incident, the) Tj
T*
(likely attribution and the recommended remediation actions.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
56 40 Td
(SAR-2026-031  |  CONFIDENTIAL  |  Page 3 of 8) Tj
ET
