(3. Scope and Methodology) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(The assessment covered the corporate IT network, remote access infrastructure and) Tj
T*
(identity services. Evidence was collected from VPN gateway logs, endpoint detection) Tj
T*
(telemetry, domain controller event logs and interviews with system owners.) Tj
T*
T*
(Forensic images were taken of each affected system before remediation.) Tj
T*
