(6. Incident Timeline) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(The incident was detected on 14 September 2026 at 02:40 IST by the SOC monitoring team.) Tj
T*
(The contractor VPN account was disabled on 14 September 2026 at 04:10 IST.) Tj
T*
(Containment was completed on 19 September 2026.) Tj
T*
T*
(Attribution: The activity may be associated with the threat group Grey Heron.) Tj
T*
(Attribution remains unconfirmed and is based on overlapping infrastructure only.) Tj
T*
T*
(The estimated recovery cost is approximately INR 1.8 crore.) Tj
T*
